<title>ESTONIA: Estonia March inflation 0.8 pct, yr/yr 9.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Estonia March inflation 0.8 pct, yr/yr 9.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Estonia was 0.8 percent on a month-on-month basis in March for an annual price rise of 9.1 percent, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN CONSUMER PRICES	    March 97    Feb 97  March 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (PCT)	 0.8	   0.9     1.6</p>
<p> Year-on-Year change (PCT)	   9.1	   9.9     28.3</p>
<p> Index change (1993 average =100)  250.3	 248.4   229.4</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
